   "words": 18,
   "text": "Abu Dawood noted 9th century collector Sunan al-Tirmidhi Hadith collection of of Hadith. An-Nasai noted 9th/early 10th century"
  },
  {
   "page": 48,
   "ids": [
    "p48b16"
   ],
   "role": "small",
   "why": "outside any article",
   "words": 22,
   "text": "Abu Isa Muhammad ibn Isa at-Tirmidhi. Tawbah turning to God in repentance. Ulema also ulama; religious scholars. Ummah religious community; followers of"
  },
  {
   "page": 48,
   "ids": [
    "p48b3",
    "p48b4"
   ],
   "role": "small",
   "why": "outside any article",
   "words": 41,
   "text": "scholar and collector of Hadith. At-Tirmidhi 9th century Islamic scholar and collector of Hadith. Dar ul-Harb Abode of War. Dar ul-Islam Abode of Islam. Dar ul-Kufr Abode of Disbelief. Dawah Conveying the message of God Din-e-ilahi a Persian term which means"
  },
  {
   "page": 48,
   "ids": [
    "p48b17"
   ],
   "role": "small",
   "why": "outside any article",
   "words": 7,
   "text": "a prophet. Yathrib now known as Madinah."
  },
  {
   "page": 48,
   "ids": [
    "p48b5",
    "p48b6",
    "p48b7",
    "p48b8",
    "p48b9",
